hq9plus programs vendored for integration testing
====================================================

.in files are programs from the upstream esolang-book-sources repo:

  https://github.com/yhara/esolang-book-sources
  copy is at internal/integrationtest/testdata/gems/esolang-book-sources/

each .in is a program from hq9plus/. .expected files generated against
MRI 2.6.10 by running:

  ruby gems/esolang-book-sources/hq9plus/hq9plus.rb <fixture>.in </dev/null > <fixture>.expected

esolang-book-sources is a book companion repo without a top-level
LICENSE file but the README treats the code as MIT-equivalent
example material.
